OpenSwoole with OpenSSL: the module openswoole of php74-openswoole built
with the OpenSSL of the base system (its SSL and TLS: SWOOLE_SSL, HTTPS,
WSS), with php74-mysqlnd-openssl instead of php74-mysqlnd; its ini comes
with its line commented out, as that of php74-openswoole. The same files
as php74-openswoole: install one of the two.

PECL openswoole for php74 of azsupport/ports, built from ext/openswoole
of the release tarball of azsupport/php-src, which bundles it:
lib/php/20190902/openswoole.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php74/conf.d.
